    <h1>Medical Disclaimer</h1>

    <p><em>Last updated: [date]</em></p>

    <h2>This site does not provide medical advice</h2>

    <p>The content on Bump Compass — including all calculators, guides, articles, and tools — is for general informational and educational purposes only. It is not medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.</p>

    <p>The calculators perform arithmetic based on standard formulas and published clinical guidelines. They do not account for your individual medical history, your specific circumstances, or any complications that may apply to you.</p>

    <h2>Always consult your own clinician</h2>

    <p>Pregnancy and postpartum care are individual. What is normal for one person may not be normal for another. Always consult your own doctor, midwife, nurse, or other qualified healthcare provider with any questions about your pregnancy, your baby, or your health.</p>

    <p>Never disregard professional medical advice, or delay seeking it, because of something you have read on this site.</p>

    <h2>Emergency situations</h2>

    <p>If you are experiencing a medical emergency, call 911 (US) or 999 (UK) immediately. Do not rely on this site for emergency medical information.</p>

    <h2>Accuracy and currency</h2>

    <p>Medical guidance changes as new research emerges. We work to keep the information on this site accurate and current, but we cannot guarantee that all content reflects the most recent guidance at all times.</p>

    <p>Where authorities disagree — on storage times, viability definitions, trimester boundaries, or other clinical questions — we show the range and name each source. This is not indecision; it is accuracy.</p>

    <h2>No patient-provider relationship</h2>

    <p>Use of this site does not create a patient-provider relationship between you and Bump Compass Editorial. We are not your healthcare provider.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate relationships</h2>

    <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. We may earn a commission if you click an affiliate link and make a purchase. This does not influence the information we present. See our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>

    <p>If you have questions about this disclaimer, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
